1.Responsible for Dark Store site selection, conducting on-site inspections, commercial district assessments and market research for new store locations within the designated area;
2.Develop territorial planning and store opening strategies based on local market characteristics and company expansion requirements;
3.Conduct commercial negotiations, contract discussions, and negotiations regarding fundamental engineering conditions for projects, while assessing risks and producing site selection reports;
